Description: Provides exact conjugate Bayesian inference for a single change point
    in the mean of a Gaussian sequence under a common variance. The package supports
    flexible weakly informative and informative conjugate prior configurations,
    including preset, direct-hyperparameter, expert-knowledge, inverse-gamma, and
    scaled inverse-chi-square interfaces, collapsed
    posterior computation, direct posterior simulation, prior-sensitivity analysis,
    operating-characteristic evaluation, numerical validation, checkpointing,
    automatic recovery, reproducible long-running simulation workflows,
    prior-data conflict diagnostics, no-change versus one-change model comparison,
    Monte Carlo uncertainty summaries, paired prior comparisons, operating-regime
    classification, bootstrap break-even thresholds, and runtime benchmarking.
